+    "ATSS (Adaptive Training Sample Selection) is an anchor-based object detection algorithm that introduces an adaptive strategy for selecting positive and negative samples during training. Instead of using fixed IoU thresholds, ATSS dynamically determines positive samples based on the statistical characteristics of object candidates for each ground truth. This improves training stability and enhances detection performance, especially for objects of varying sizes and aspect ratios.": "ATSS（自适应训练样本选择）是一种基于锚框的目标检测算法，在训练时自适应选择正负样本。它依据每个真实目标对应候选框的统计特征确定正样本，而非使用固定的 IoU 阈值，从而改善训练稳定性和不同尺寸、宽高比目标的检测效果。",
+    "D-FINE is a powerful real-time object detector that redefines the bounding box regression task in DETRs as Fine-grained Distribution Refinement (FDR). Combined with the DEIM adaptive augmentation scheduling framework (enabled by default), it achieves outstanding performance with faster convergence.": "D-FINE 是一种实时目标检测器，将 DETR 中的矩形框回归任务重新定义为细粒度分布细化（FDR）。结合默认启用的 DEIM 自适应增强调度框架，可实现出色的检测表现和更快的收敛。",
+    "DINOv2 is a self-supervised vision transformer model trained with a combination of discriminative and generative pretraining objectives. It produces robust, general-purpose visual features that transfer well to classification tasks. Fine-tuning uses DoRA (Weight-Decomposed Low-Rank Adaptation) for parameter-efficient training, making it especially effective for small-dataset regimes.": "DINOv2 是自监督视觉 Transformer，通过判别式和生成式预训练目标学习稳健、通用的视觉特征，适合迁移到分类任务。微调使用 DoRA（权重分解低秩适配）进行参数高效训练，尤其适合较小的数据集。",
+    "DINOv3-DETR is an efficient end-to-end object detection transformer that leverages the DEIMv2 training framework with a DINOv3 backbone, achieving strong accuracy with fewer parameters.": "DINOv3-DETR 是高效的端到端目标检测 Transformer，将 DINOv3 主干网络与 DEIMv2 训练框架结合，以较少参数获得较高准确率。",
+    "EdgeCrafter detection model (ECDet-L) combines an efficient ECViT backbone with a hybrid encoder and transformer decoder for real-time, high-accuracy object detection with low latency.": "EdgeCrafter 检测模型（ECDet-L）结合高效 ECViT 主干网络、混合编码器和 Transformer 解码器，实现低延迟、高准确率的实时目标检测。",
+    "EdgeCrafter detection model (ECDet-M) combines an efficient ECViT backbone with a hybrid encoder and transformer decoder for real-time, high-accuracy object detection with low latency.": "EdgeCrafter 检测模型（ECDet-M）结合高效 ECViT 主干网络、混合编码器和 Transformer 解码器，实现低延迟、高准确率的实时目标检测。",
+    "EdgeCrafter detection model (ECDet-S) combines an efficient ECViT backbone with a hybrid encoder and transformer decoder for real-time, high-accuracy object detection with low latency.": "EdgeCrafter 检测模型（ECDet-S）结合高效 ECViT 主干网络、混合编码器和 Transformer 解码器，实现低延迟、高准确率的实时目标检测。",
+    "EdgeCrafter detection model (ECDet-X) combines an efficient ECViT backbone with a hybrid encoder and transformer decoder for real-time, high-accuracy object detection with low latency.": "EdgeCrafter 检测模型（ECDet-X）结合高效 ECViT 主干网络、混合编码器和 Transformer 解码器，实现低延迟、高准确率的实时目标检测。",
+    "EfficientNet-B0 is the baseline model of the EfficientNet family, designed using neural architecture search to optimize accuracy and efficiency. It uses a compound scaling method to balance network depth, width, and resolution, achieving strong performance with relatively low computational cost and around 5.3M parameters.": "EfficientNet-B0 是 EfficientNet 系列的基础模型，通过神经架构搜索优化准确率和效率。它使用复合缩放平衡网络深度、宽度和分辨率，约有 530 万参数，以较低计算开销取得良好表现。",
+    "EfficientNet-B3 is a scaled-up version of EfficientNet-B0, offering improved accuracy by increasing the network's depth, width, and resolution using compound scaling. It provides a good balance between performance and computational cost, making it suitable for applications that require higher accuracy without significantly sacrificing efficiency.": "EfficientNet-B3 是 EfficientNet-B0 的扩展版本，通过复合缩放增加网络深度、宽度和分辨率，提高准确率，同时兼顾计算成本，适合需要更高准确率且希望保持效率的场景。",
+    "EfficientNetV2-Small is a compact and fast classification model that combines neural architecture search with training-aware optimizations. It introduces fused MBConv layers for early-stage acceleration and improves training speed while maintaining accuracy, making it ideal for edge and mobile devices.": "EfficientNetV2-Small 是紧凑、快速的分类模型，结合神经架构搜索和面向训练的优化，通过融合 MBConv 层加速早期阶段，在保持准确率的同时提高训练速度，适合边缘和移动设备。",
+    "Mask R-CNN with a ResNet-50 backbone is a widely used instance segmentation model that balances accuracy and speed. The ResNet-50 backbone provides strong feature extraction, while the Mask R-CNN head enables precise object detection and mask prediction for each instance.": "采用 ResNet-50 主干网络的 Mask R-CNN 是兼顾准确率和速度的常用实例分割模型。ResNet-50 提供强大的特征提取能力，Mask R-CNN 检测头负责目标检测和各实例的掩码预测。",
+    "MobileNetV3-Large is a lightweight and efficient image classification model tailored for high-performance applications on mobile and embedded devices. It combines MobileNetV2’s inverted residuals with enhancements like squeeze-and-excitation (SE) blocks, hard-swish activation, and neural architecture search for optimal speed-accuracy trade-offs.": "MobileNetV3-Large 是面向移动和嵌入式设备的轻量、高效图像分类模型。它将 MobileNetV2 的倒残差结构与 SE 模块、hard-swish 激活和神经架构搜索结合，平衡速度和准确率。",
+    "RF-DETR for instance segmentation extends the RF-DETR object detector with mask prediction capabilities, providing high-accuracy instance segmentation with real-time performance.": "RF-DETR 实例分割模型在 RF-DETR 目标检测器的基础上增加掩码预测能力，兼顾分割准确率和实时性能。",
+    "RF-DETR is a real-time object detection model that combines a DINOv2 vision transformer backbone with a novel decoder for high-accuracy detection without NMS post-processing.": "RF-DETR 是实时目标检测模型，结合 DINOv2 视觉 Transformer 主干网络和新型解码器，无需 NMS 后处理即可实现高准确率检测。",
+    "RT-DETR is a real-time object detection algorithm based on the transformer architecture. It combines a convolutional backbone with an efficient encoder-decoder transformer to directly predict object classes and bounding boxes without the need for anchor boxes or NMS.": "RT-DETR 是基于 Transformer 的实时目标检测算法，结合卷积主干网络和高效编码器、解码器，直接预测对象类别和矩形框，无需锚框或 NMS。",
+    "RTMDet for instance segmentation extends the real-time object detection framework with mask prediction capabilities. It features a unified, anchor-free architecture with a decoupled head and task-specific neck, enabling high-performance instance segmentation with real-time inference speed.": "RTMDet 实例分割模型为实时目标检测框架增加掩码预测能力。统一的无锚框架构、解耦检测头和专用特征融合网络，使其兼顾分割效果和实时推理速度。",
+    "SSD (Single Shot MultiBox Detector) is a real-time, anchor-based object detection algorithm that performs object localization and classification in a single forward pass. It uses a convolutional backbone and multiple feature maps at different scales to detect objects of various sizes. SSD balances speed and accuracy, making it efficient for deployment on resource-constrained devices.": "SSD（单次多框检测器）是基于锚框的实时目标检测算法，通过一次前向传播完成定位和分类，利用卷积主干和多尺度特征图检测不同大小的目标，兼顾速度和准确率，适合资源受限的设备。",
+    "This model combines the Mask R-CNN framework with a Swin-Tiny transformer backbone, leveraging hierarchical attention and shifted windows for better spatial understanding. It delivers enhanced instance segmentation performance, especially on complex scenes, while maintaining a lightweight transformer design.": "该模型将 Mask R-CNN 与 Swin-Tiny Transformer 主干结合，利用分层注意力和移位窗口增强空间理解，尤其适合复杂场景，并保留轻量 Transformer 的特点。",
+    "This model integrates Mask R-CNN with an EfficientNet-B2B backbone, combining the accuracy of a region-based detection approach with the efficiency of the EfficientNet architecture. It offers strong instance segmentation performance with reduced computational cost, making it suitable for scenarios where both precision and efficiency are important.": "该模型将 Mask R-CNN 与 EfficientNet-B2B 主干结合，兼顾区域检测的准确性和 EfficientNet 的效率，以较低计算开销提供良好的实例分割效果。",
+    "ViT-Tiny (Vision Transformer) is a lightweight transformer-based model for image classification. It uses a standard ViT architecture with Google Brain pretrained weights (ImageNet-21k pre-training, ImageNet-1k fine-tuning). ViT-Tiny is the smallest variant, optimized for speed and efficiency while maintaining competitive performance on image classification tasks.": "ViT-Tiny 是用于图像分类的轻量视觉 Transformer，使用标准 ViT 架构和 Google Brain 预训练权重（ImageNet-21k 预训练、ImageNet-1k 微调）。它是最小变体，注重速度和效率，同时保持有竞争力的分类表现。",
+    "YOLO11-L is the large Ultralytics YOLO11 detection model. It offers high accuracy while using the Geti Tune data pipeline for preprocessing and dataset handling.": "YOLO11-L 是 Ultralytics YOLO11 的大型目标检测模型，提供较高准确率，并使用 Geti Tune 数据流水线进行预处理和数据集管理。",
