+    "YOLOX is a high-performance, anchor-free object detection algorithm that builds on the YOLO series with modern improvements. It features a decoupled head for separate classification and regression tasks, strong data augmentation techniques, and advanced label assignment strategies. YOLOX achieves a great balance between speed and accuracy, making it suitable for real-time applications across various domains.": "YOLOX 是高性能无锚框目标检测算法，在 YOLO 系列基础上采用分类与回归解耦的检测头、较强的数据增强和先进的标签分配策略，兼顾速度与准确率，适用于各种实时应用。",
